Now UI. In the 做题 card, add dropdown after 强制答题间隔:

```dart
_intDropdown(
  label: '每次答题题量',
  value: _config.questionCount,
  options: const [1, 2, 3, 4, 5],
  optionLabel: (value) => '$value 题',
  onChanged: (value) => setState(() {
    _config = _config.copyWith(questionCount: value);
  }),
),
const SizedBox(height: 4),
Text('到点后需要连续答完这几道题，答对总分达到门槛才算通过', style: theme.textTheme.bodySmall),
const SizedBox(height: 12),
```

The `_intDropdown` merges current value into options and sorts; fine.

Also the quiz toggle subtitle "每 N 分钟弹一次题，答对才能继续看" — maybe mention N 题. Update subtitle to include 题量: `'默认开启：每 X 分钟弹一次题，每次 Y 题，答对才能继续看'`. Nice.

Test device_page_test constructs TvConfig; need add questionCount arg. Let me view it.

